\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Price</p><p class=\"font-semibold text-zinc-900\">One-time payment ($0.5-$10 USDT)</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium mb-2\">Pros</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Pay once, use forever</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">No unexpected subscription cancellations</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Better for occasional users</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Lower long-term cost</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Own your access permanently</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">No credit card or subscription management</span></li></ul></div><div><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 font-medium mb-2\">Cons</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">May need to repurchase for major version updates</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Cloud features less common</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Support may be limited</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"border border-zinc-200 rounded-lg p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-4\">subscription-tools</h3><div class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 mb-1\">Price</p><p class=\"font-semibold text-zinc-900\">$10-50/month ongoing</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium mb-2\">Pros</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Access to latest features always</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Cloud storage often included</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Regular updates and improvements</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Customer support usually better</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Often includes multiple tools</span></li></ul></div><div><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 font-medium mb-2\">Cons</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Ongoing cost adds up significantly</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Cancel anytime risk</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Often underutilized</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">Prices increase over time</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-red-500\">✗</span><span class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">You&#x27;re renting, not owning</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-zinc-50 p-6 rounded-lg\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\">Which is Best For You?</h3><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-medium text-zinc-900 mb-2\">one-time-payment-tools</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Occasional users</li><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Budget-conscious users</li><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Those wanting ownership</li><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Small businesses with limited budgets</li><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Users of specialized tools</li></ul></div><div><p class=\"font-medium text-zinc-900 mb-2\">subscription-tools</p><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Heavy daily users</li><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Teams needing collaboration</li><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Enterprise users</li><li class=\"text-sm text-zinc-700\">• <!-- -->Those needing latest features always</li></ul></div></div></div></div></article><div class=\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-4\">More Comparisons</h2><p class=\"text-zinc-600 mb-4\">Find the perfect tool for your needs.</p><div class=\"flex gap-4\"><a class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-200 text-zinc-700 rounded-lg transition-colors\" href=\"/geo\">All Comparisons</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\" href=\"/store\">Browse Tools</a></div></div></div></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-041036350e5300f1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/4473ecc91f70f139-s.p.woff\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff\\\"}]\\n2:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/463dafcda517f24f-s.p.woff\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff\\\"}]\\n3:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/83d6f755ebd559b7.css\\\",\\\"style\\\